\\[CapitalGamma]_10 is NUMERIC-ONLY (0.0714575, no committed exact rational \
certificate \\[LongDash] the k=10 generator ran but no exact block \
certificate is in the repository). It is recorded honestly as a numeric \
bracket point, NOT as a kernel-recomputed exact object, and the certified \
\\[Epsilon] uses it as documented in CONVERGENCE-ANALYSIS-2026-07-13.md:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"3e38ed67-0731-6140-a949-4385306ce3a2"],

Cell["\<\
